NOTICE — research prototype, not a medical device.

BioTwin.X is a research proof-of-concept built for the Happiest Health Digital
Twin Challenge 2026. It is trained and evaluated exclusively on synthetic data
generated by `synthetic_generator.py`. It has not been validated on human
subjects, has not received regulatory clearance, and must not be used for
diagnosis, treatment, triage, or any other clinical decision.
